<section id="s-wte-template--19526978175110__section_what_to_expect_nXxXNh" class="s-wte">
  <div class="wte__container">
      <h2 class="wte__title"><p>What you should expect<br/>from <em><strong>using Earthly Derm Daily</strong></em></p></h2>

    <div class="wte__timeline">
      <div class="wte__spine" aria-hidden="true"></div>



        <article
          class="wte__block wte__block--left"

        >
          <div class="wte__badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M16.7 5.3c.4.4.4 1 0 1.4l-8 8c-.4.4-1 .4-1.4 0l-4-4c-.4-.4-.4-1 0-1.4.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0L8 12.6l7.3-7.3c.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0z" fill="#ffffff"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="wte__block-inner">
            <div class="wte__spine-gap" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wte__content-column">
              <div class="wte__content">
                  <div class="wte__date">🗓️ FIRST USE</div>

                  <div class="wte__highlighted-text">
                      <strong>The bar gets to work immediately</strong>

                     The plant ash sinks into your pores from day one, lifting out the trapped oil and dirt your breakouts feed on.

                  </div>

                  <h3 class="wte__label">Your skin already feels different</h3>

                <dl class="wte__info-items">





                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Skin feels instantly softer and cleaner</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">No tightness, no stripping, no irritation</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Skin that looks alive, not just clean</dd>
                      </div>







                </dl>

              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wte__image-column">
            </div>

          </div>
        </article>



        <article
          class="wte__block wte__block--right"

        >
          <div class="wte__badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M16.7 5.3c.4.4.4 1 0 1.4l-8 8c-.4.4-1 .4-1.4 0l-4-4c-.4-.4-.4-1 0-1.4.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0L8 12.6l7.3-7.3c.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0z" fill="#ffffff"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="wte__block-inner">
            <div class="wte__spine-gap" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wte__content-column">
              <div class="wte__content">
                  <div class="wte__date">🗓️ WEEKS 2-3</div>

                  <div class="wte__highlighted-text">
                      <strong>Acne visibly improves</strong>

                     With your pores staying clean, the breakouts you already have start clearing while fewer new ones come through. Your skin looks clearer than it has in months.

                  </div>

                  <h3 class="wte__label">People are starting to notice</h3>

                <dl class="wte__info-items">





                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Existing breakouts shrink and fade</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Fewer new ones appear</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">People start asking what's changed</dd>
                      </div>







                </dl>

              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wte__image-column">
            </div>

          </div>
        </article>



        <article
          class="wte__block wte__block--left"

        >
          <div class="wte__badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M16.7 5.3c.4.4.4 1 0 1.4l-8 8c-.4.4-1 .4-1.4 0l-4-4c-.4-.4-.4-1 0-1.4.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0L8 12.6l7.3-7.3c.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0z" fill="#ffffff"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="wte__block-inner">
            <div class="wte__spine-gap" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wte__content-column">
              <div class="wte__content">
                  <div class="wte__date">🗓️ DAY 60</div>

                  <div class="wte__highlighted-text">
                      <strong>Full Results Building</strong>

                     New pimples barely surface now, and the rare one clears fast. After every product that broke its promise, this is the first time your skin feels genuinely clear of acne, and like it's staying that way.

                  </div>

                  <h3 class="wte__label">You can feel it holding</h3>

                <dl class="wte__info-items">





                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Acne is rare now instead of a constant fight</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Skin stays clear and smooth</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">You stop bracing for the next breakout</dd>
                      </div>







                </dl>

              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wte__image-column">
            </div>

          </div>
        </article>



        <article
          class="wte__block wte__block--right"

        >
          <div class="wte__badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M16.7 5.3c.4.4.4 1 0 1.4l-8 8c-.4.4-1 .4-1.4 0l-4-4c-.4-.4-.4-1 0-1.4.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0L8 12.6l7.3-7.3c.4-.4 1-.4 1.4 0z" fill="#ffffff"/>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="wte__block-inner">
            <div class="wte__spine-gap" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="wte__content-column">
              <div class="wte__content">
                  <div class="wte__date">🗓️ DAY 90</div>

                  <div class="wte__highlighted-text">
                      <strong>A New You</strong>

                     Three months of sticking with it has done what years of other products couldn't. Your skin is calmer and clearer than you can remember, breakouts are far less of a battle, and for the first time it feels like your skin is on your side.

                  </div>

                  <h3 class="wte__label">What you've been working towards</h3>

                <dl class="wte__info-items">





                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Skin that's clear and stays clear</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Smooth, soft skin</dd>
                      </div>






                      <div class="wte__info-item">
                        <dd class="wte__info-text">Healthy & restored skin barrier</dd>
                      </div>







                </dl>

              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wte__image-column">
            </div>

          </div>
        </article>

